            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>MDMA, better known as the recreational drug &quot;ecstasy,&quot; is well known for stimulating a feeling of closeness and empathy in its users. We advocate that exploring its mechanism of action could lead to new treatments for psychiatric conditions characterized by impairments in social behavior.</AbstractText>
